  <body>
    <div id="root"><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/meteoerait-workflow-DWFGqmCS.svg"/><div class="governance-site warm-signal "><header class="governance-header"><div class="governance-header-inner"><a aria-label="Meteoerait home" href="/" class="governance-brand"><span class="brand-lockup"><svg class="brand-lockup-mark" viewBox="0 0 58 58" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 41.5V16.5C8 14.01 10.01 12 12.5 12h4.8c1.6 0 3.09.88 3.85 2.29L29 29.2l7.85-14.91A4.36 4.36 0 0 1 40.7 12h4.8c2.49 0 4.5 2.01 4.5 4.5v25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 41.5c8.1-5.77 14.95-5.77 21 0 6.05 5.77 12.9 5.77 21 0" stroke="var(--gov-coral)" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="29" cy="29.2" r="3.2" fill="var(--gov-coral)"></circle><circle cx="29" cy="29.2" r="7.2" stroke="var(--gov-coral)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".28"></circle></svg><span class="brand-lockup-type"><span class="brand-lockup-name">Meteoer<span class="brand-lockup-accent">ai</span>t</span><span class="brand-lockup-tagline">eriskmonitor / control</span></span></span></a><nav class="governance-nav " aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/what-changes">What changes</a><a href="/questions">Questions</a><a href="/who-its-for">Who it&#x27;s for</a><a href="/about">About us</a><a href="/contact">Contact us</a><a href="/contact" class="mobile-book-button">Book a demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></nav><a href="/contact" class="governance-header-cta">Book a demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a><button class="governance-menu-button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id="top"><section class="governance-hero" style="min-height:auto;padding-bottom:110px"><div class="governance-hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="governance-hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="governance-page-width governance-hero-layout" style="display:block"><div class="governance-hero-copy" style="max-width:850px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h1>The same numbers in the board pack and in the exam file, and a trail behind every one of them.</h1><p class="governance-subhead">A risk management platform your own team configures. Every score shows its inputs, its weighting and who changed what.</p><div class="governance-actions"><a href="/contact" class="governance-button governance-button-coral">Book a demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a href="/setup" class="governance-text-button">See what setup actually involves <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="governance-section home-workflow" aria-labelledby="home-workflow-title"><div class="governance-page-width"><div class="home-workflow-heading"><div><span class="governance-eyebrow"><span></span>How it works</span><h2 id="home-workflow-title">The whole picture, from source to sign-off.</h2></div><p>A conceptual view of how module-level data becomes a reviewed enterprise picture. This is not a screenshot of the product.</p></div><figure class="home-workflow-figure"><div class="home-workflow-image-scroll"><img src="/assets/meteoerait-workflow-DWFGqmCS.svg" alt="Twelve business modules each ingest and score their own data. AI drafts a report from scored findings, analysts review it before publication, and Apex rolls the approved findings into one enterprise view." width="1600" height="900"/></div><figcaption>Explore the full flow: <a href="/assets/meteoerait-workflow-DWFGqmCS.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the image at full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="governance-section" style="background:var(--gov-paper-bright);padding:100px 0"><div class="governance-page-width"><p style="font-size:clamp(21px, 3vw, 26px);line-height:1.6;max-width:820px;font-weight:500;color:var(--gov-ink);margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.02em;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)">Your risk register is a spreadsheet. Your board pack is rebuilt by hand each quarter. Your evidence sits in shared drives and old email chains. That held up through earlier exam cycles. It doesn&#x27;t answer questions about version control.</p></div></section><section class="governance-section" style="background:var(--gov-paper);border-top:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><div class="governance-page-width"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 42px);margin:0 0 60px 0">Three things live here</h2></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:40px"><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 style="font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600">The register</h3><p style="color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;max-width:320px">One list of risks, with owners, ratings and treatment plans. Divisions, entities or business lines keep their own view of it.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 style="font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600">The appetite view</h3><p style="color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;max-width:320px">Where each risk sits against the tolerance the board set. Read as a position, not a heat map.</p></div><div style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 style="font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:600">The trail</h3><p style="color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;max-width:320px">Every change to every risk, control and assessment, with a date and a name against it.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="governance-section" style="background:var(--gov-paper-bright);border-top:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><div class="governance-page-width"><div style="max-width:640px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 42px);margin:0 0 24px 0">You might not need this</h2><p style="color:var(--gov-muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:32px">Sometimes the spreadsheet is right. If your register is under 4 risks, one person maintains it, and no examiner has asked you about version control, a spreadsheet is cheaper and faster. The case for a platform starts when the questions do.</p><a style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:var(--gov-coral);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em" href="/questions">The other questions we get asked <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class="governance-section" style="background:var(--gov-paper);border-top:1px solid var(--gov-line);padding-bottom:160px"><div class="governance-page-width"><div style="max-width:720px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px, 4vw, 42px);margin:0 0 40px 0">What brought you here</h2><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><li style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><a href="/financial-institutions" class="homepage-trigger-link"><span>An exam or audit finding named your risk register.</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><a href="/group-risk" class="homepage-trigger-link"><span>You acquired a division nobody can see into.</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><a href="/operational-resilience" class="homepage-trigger-link"><span>An outage became a reportable event.</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li><li style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--gov-line)"><a href="/excel-risk-register" class="homepage-trigger-link"><span>Your register is still in Excel.</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="governance-cta"><div class="governance-cta-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="governance-page-width" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center"><div style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(38px, 5vw, 60px);margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.05">See it against your own register</h2><p style="color:#f9e8dd;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:540px;margin:0 auto 36px">Bring one risk from your current spreadsheet. We&#x27;ll show you what it looks like in the register, in the appetite view and in the trail.</p><a href="/contact" class="governance-button governance-button-light">Book a demo <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></main><footer class="governance-footer"><div class="governance-page-width governance-footer-main"><a aria-label="Meteoerait home" href="/" class="governance-brand governance-footer-brand"><span class="brand-lockup"><svg class="brand-lockup-mark" viewBox="0 0 58 58" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 41.5V16.5C8 14.01 10.01 12 12.5 12h4.8c1.6 0 3.09.88 3.85 2.29L29 29.2l7.85-14.91A4.36 4.36 0 0 1 40.7 12h4.8c2.49 0 4.5 2.01 4.5 4.5v25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 41.5c8.1-5.77 14.95-5.77 21 0 6.05 5.77 12.9 5.77 21 0" stroke="var(--gov-coral)" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="29" cy="29.2" r="3.2" fill="var(--gov-coral)"></circle><circle cx="29" cy="29.2" r="7.2" stroke="var(--gov-coral)" stroke-width="1.2" opacity=".28"></circle></svg><span class="brand-lockup-type"><span class="brand-lockup-name">Meteoer<span class="brand-lockup-accent">ai</span>t</span><span class="brand-lockup-tagline">eriskmonitor / control</span></span></span></a><p>We help you record risk.<br/><strong>Meteoerait helps you control the record.</strong></p><div class="governance-footer-links"><a href="/what-changes">What changes</a><a href="/questions">Questions</a><a href="/who-its-for">Who it&#x27;s for</a><a href="/about">About us</a><a href="/contact">Contact us</a></div></div><div class="governance-page-width governance-footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Meteoerait Software P Ltd.</span><span>Configurable by your team. Traceable by design.</span><span>Privacy <i></i> Terms</span></div></footer></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events:none"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div></div>
